Usage: raphael favorites [options]

List favorites by title.

List favorite areas and projects by title. Archived favorites are left out and stay favorites.

Options:
      --skip <n>
      Number of results to skip. Default: 0.
      --limit <n>
      Page size, 1 to 500. Default: 50.
      --json
      Print one JSON result.
  -h, --help
      Show this help.

Examples:
  raphael favorites
  raphael favorites --limit 20
  raphael favorites --skip 20 --limit 20 --json

Prints:
  A page of items. JSON carries `items` and `page`; paging notes go to stderr.

Next: raphael get --id 42

